  "name": "GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst",
  "family": "OpenAI",
  "description": "OpenAI's high-fidelity image model (September 2026) for detail-rich edits; slower than Flare. Also on WaveSpeedAI. Also on Comfy Cloud. Also on ToAPIs. Also on OpenRouter. Run against the live API through OpenRouter since 2026-09-21; the other providers' adapters are written from their docs and not run live yet. Also on Comfy Router.",
