          1536
        ]
      },
      "note": "Runs on OpenRouter (one key for many models); run against the live API since 2026-09-21. The pictures go inline in the request to OpenRouter, which passes them to OpenAI. No mask input on OpenRouter: the mask goes along as a second picture and the prompt says what it means; the stitch keeps the selection anyway. An edit sends no aspect, so the host keeps the crop's shape as its own edit endpoint does (not verified); an answer of another shape is centre-cropped. There is no size parameter: the host picks the output size (OpenRouter's one example is GPT Image 2 at 16:9 and high quality: 1536 x 864; no size is stated for other models or qualities)."
    },
