      "note": "Runs on Comfy Router (api.comfy.org) with the Comfy Cloud key, billed in Comfy credits, no paid plan needed; not run against the live API yet. The pictures go inline in the request to Comfy, which passes them to OpenAI. The Router takes OpenAI's own request: an edit with the selection as mask (transparent = repaint), Background \"transparent\" for a cut-out with a real alpha channel (PNG or WebP only). The mask may be 4 MB at most, at most sixteen pictures go in (the crop, Original and the reference layers)."
